  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ADDED\n- Test Store `test_` API keys now work on iOS: the bundled RevenueCat xcframework is built from source with `BYPASS_SIMULATED_STORE_RELEASE_CHECK`, so Release builds no longer force-close. Requires `Kebechet.Maui.RevenueCat.iOS` 5.72.0.2. #116\n- `PurchaseResultDto.ErrorMessage` carries the underlying store error details on failed purchases (null on success and user cancellation); `ErrorStatus` stays the value to branch on.\n\nFIXED\n- Android purchase launch is marshalled to the main thread, so `PurchaseProduct` can be called from any thread; background callers previously crashed with a Looper error under the Test Store. Synchronous launch failures now surface through the result instead of crashing the app.\n- iOS `GetStorefrontCountryCode` returns ISO alpha-2 (`US`) instead of StoreKit's alpha-3 (`USA`), matching the documented contract and the Android implementation.\n\nCHANGED\n- `CheckTrialOrIntroDiscountEligibility` documented as iOS-only: Android throws `NotImplementedException`, the Mac Catalyst stub returns an empty dictionary.",
